                                "sense_id": "ad98430f-0668-3695-a077-185da7e867cf",
                                "text": "Correct. That was actually my first internet controversy many years ago, with the kinists, white identitarians — I call them skinists. And I’ve been in polemical firefights with antisemites and actual misogynists, not people who are accused of being that way."
